      "content": "…; sale, Hendrik Albertus M. Croockewit (1784-1863, Amsterdam), Amsterdam (J.C. van Pappelendam and G.J. Schouten), 16 December 1874 <em>sqq.</em>, no. 143 (‘Jacob et ses fils. Composition de dix figures à la plume avec de l’encre brune’), fl. 1,020, to Barthold Suermondt (1818-87), Aachen (L. 415);{Copy RKD.} his sale, Frankfurt-am-Main (F.A.C. Prestel), 5 May 1879 <em>sqq.</em>, no. 128 (‘Jacob assis dans un fauteuil, entouré de ses fils. Composition de dix figures. Dessin magnifique à la plume’), 750 DM;{Copy RKD.} …; collection William Pitcairn Knowles (1820-94), Rotterdam and Wiesbaden (L. 2643); his sale, Amsterdam (F. Muller & Co.), 25 (26) June 1895 <em>sqq.</em>, no. 522, fl. 300, to the dealer C.F. Roos, Amsterdam, for the Vereniging Rembrandt;{Copy RKD; note RMA.} from whom, fl. 345, to the museum (L. 2228), 1901",
